            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "key": "x-api-key",
              "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
              "placement": "header"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Retrieves statistics about campaigns in a workspace including attack events counts.\nDescription of the events can be found at https://docs.tryriot.com/api-reference/simulation/list-attacks#response-type\n\n\n**Scopes required:**\n- simulation:read"
        },
